    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch01-04: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.23";
    dc:description "Model comparison can probe examples with public data. The near-universal failure claim and the asserted limitation of natural selection are too vague and broad for existing benchmarks to resolve as stated.";
